-  sept [order=10]
-  shrine_types [order=20]
-  foundry_delivery [order=30]
'  Stable renderer-neutral pronunciation carriers.  Behavior is deliberately
'  split into bounded modules: Hole extraction, occurrence construction,
'  traversal, and accessors.  Keeping these nominals at the established module
'  boundary preserves direct-import visibility for every terminal consumer.

+  projection_pronunciation_hole
  '  An unresolved semantic choice retained for a terminal.  subject and
  '  source are convenient projections of the untouched parameter row;
  '  address and semantic fallbacks remain distinct.
  :  kind=iota
     role=path
     fallback=maybe[projection_address]
     semantic_fallback=maybe[path]
     subject=maybe[path]
     source=maybe[path]
     parameters=row[projection_parameter]

+  projection_pronunciation_occurrence
  '  One visible occurrence in pre-order.  semantic_address identifies the
  '  shared definition; placement_address and placement_role retain its local
  '  context.  Strict roots carry their unique root-scoped Resolution Context;
  '  strict children carry the exact placement reference.  None is legacy.
  '  An inline placement hole has no semantic_address.
  :  semantic_address=maybe[projection_address]
     placement_address=maybe[projection_address]
     parent_address=maybe[projection_address]
     depth=nat
     kind=iota
     role=path
     parameters=row[projection_parameter]
     placement_role=maybe[path]
     placement_parameters=row[projection_parameter]
     resolution_context=maybe[foundry_digest]
     hole=maybe[projection_pronunciation_hole]

+  projection_pronunciation
  '  Renderer-neutral terminal input.  roots preserve manifest order and
  '  occurrences preserve every parent's declared placement order.
  :  revision=foundry_digest
     roots=row[projection_address]
     occurrences=row[projection_pronunciation_occurrence]

+  projection_pronunciation_refusal
  :  code=iota at=maybe[projection_address]

+  projection_pronunciation_result
  &  projection_pronunciation_result/admitted
     projection_pronunciation_result/refused

  +  admitted
    :  pronunciation=projection_pronunciation
  +  refused
    :  refusal=projection_pronunciation_refusal

+  projection_pronunciation_walk_result
  &  projection_pronunciation_walk_result/admitted
     projection_pronunciation_walk_result/refused

  +  admitted
    :  occurrences=row[projection_pronunciation_occurrence]
  +  refused
    :  refusal=projection_pronunciation_refusal
